REQUIRES HEADER cpp
REQUIRES HEADER sdl2
REQUIRES HEADER imgui
REQUIRES LIB SDL2
REQUIRES LIB imgui
REQUIRES LIB dolly-gpu
REQUIRES TOOL c++
REQUIRES TOOL mojo
REQUIRES TOOL rm

SOURCE /dist/static/deep-hedger/dh-gui.cpp 9fe3d9c5dc8f42bde2b8b17a42eb7899ab00dadd70376b8631b847941aad580d /tmp/deep-hedger/dh-gui.cpp
