SLOP mojo build -o /usr/bin/dh-fit /tmp/deep-hedger/dh-fit.mojo
EXPORTS TOOL dh-gui
EXPORTS TOOL dh-fit
FILE /usr/share/man/cat1/dh-gui.1
    dh-gui: the deep hedger. Loads a live option chain (marketdata.app; AAPL
    needs no token), shows its bids and asks, and fits a path law to them with
    dh-fit: the model's bid and ask of every contract are what hedging its
    two sides costs along the law's paths.
    
      dh-gui                    Escape or Ctrl+C in the terminal ends it
      dh-fit CHAIN PATHS SEED   the fit alone, reporting on stdout
      dh-fit check CHAIN PATHS  its gradients against finite differences
    
    dh-fit needs gpu@0; curl fetches the chain through http@0.
